					<v8:content>Nguồn sàng lọc hóa đơn</v8:content>
				</v8:item>
			</title>
			<presentationExpression>Case When Not ValueIsFilled(AccountSpecificationSource) Then &amp;WithoutSpecification Else AccountSpecificationSource End</presentationExpression>
